  {
   "title": "trailer launch",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p><strong>James Gunn</strong> introduced <strong>Craig Gillespie</strong> before the teaser trailer played twice, giving guests a second chance to catch every detail. They welcomed Supergirl, <strong>Milly Alcock,</strong> to the stage for a brief Q&amp;A before transitioning to a casual party.</p>"
