  {
   "title": "trailer reaction booth",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>After the trailer premiere, guests stepped into a branded booth to rewatch it, record their reactions, and share the videos with their audiences after the event.</p>"
    },
