  {
   "title": "party vibes",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>To directly tie back to the trailer, which featured Blondie’s “Call Me,” <strong>Tammy Faye Starlite</strong> took the stage immediately afterward with a Blondie cover band, delivering a 30-minute set of greatest hits. Between stage moments, a curated playlist inspired by Supergirl kept the energy high while guests danced and nightlife photographer <strong>Matt Weinberger</strong> captured the evening.</p>"
